# 줄바꿈 SSOT: 저장소 = LF (Windows 개발 PC + Linux CI · ADR-016)
# core.autocrlf 개별 설정과 무관하게 모든 clone에서 동일하게 동작한다.
* text=auto eol=lf

# 바이너리 (줄바꿈 변환·diff 금지)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.svgz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.wasm binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary

# lockfile: 병합 충돌 시 재생성 (수동 병합 금지)
pnpm-lock.yaml merge=binary -diff
